  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Guido de Piccolominibus dat Ubertino de Tolomeis terram arabilem sitam in contrata Sancti Donati cum iure seminandi et metendi, et accipit in permutatione terram in loco qui dicitur Costalpina cum vineis et olivetis, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc permutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum permutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Rainerius de Forteguerri</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Albertus filius Bonacursi</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Farinatus de Berardenga</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
